  message: "Not a bug. The 11 'dropped' nodes are at depth 8-9, and tier1 slice uses hops=7 (vs full slice hops=10). They're excluded by the hop limit, not the tier filter. The tier filter correctly defaults missing supply_chain_tier to 1. Closing as invalid."  # cbea
